            <ArticleTitle>Complications associated with equine arthroscopy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>573-89, viii</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.cveq.2008.10.009</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Arthroscopic complications are infrequent but when they occur can cause significant morbidity in the equine patient. This article reviews intraoperative and postoperative complications along with ways to avoid them. Additionally, therapeutic methods of managing these complications also are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
